<title>USA: Enron acquires 32 pct of Kafus.</title>
<headline>Enron acquires 32 pct of Kafus.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enron Corp said its Enron Capital &amp; Trade Resources subsidiary has acquired 32 percent of Kafus Capital Corp for $21 million.</p>
<p>Through its investment in Kafus, Enron is helping to finance a fiberboard manufacturing facility in Riverside, Calif., to be developed by Kafus' CanFibre Group Ltd subsidiary.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
